{
    "Captain.Li Hong:We have been tracking that pumpkin for a while.": {
        "chi": "uuz：我们追踪那个南瓜已经有一段时间了"
    },
    "Captain.Li Hong:Intelligence indicates it's in a nearby town named Dreamer.": {
        "chi": "pop子：情报显示它在附近一个叫梦想家的小镇上。"
    },
    "Doctor.He:It has destroyed several areas.": {
        "chi": "仙客来：它已经杀头了几个玩家"
    },
    "Doctor.He:We must stop it.": {
        "chi": "pop子：我们必须阻止它继续杀头"
    },
    "Captain.Li Hong:The road to the town all have been blocked.": {
        "chi": "uuz：通往镇上的路都被堵死了"
    },
    "***The Door Will Open In 45 Seconds***": {
        "chi": "***南瓜只因门将在 45 秒内打开***"
    },
    "Captain.Li Hong:I know a way under train station can go to the town,let's go!We don't have enough time!": {
        "chi": "uuz：我知道火车站下面有路可以去镇上，我们走吧！这场战斗并非势均力敌！"
