    "***Captain.Li Hong:I think it will be best......***": {
        "chi": "***uuz：我这东西我在狮子王见过***"
    },
    "Captain.Li Hong:Looks like this town's been through a war.": {
        "chi": "uuz：这个小镇经历了一场战争"
    },
    "Doctor.He:Yes,we must go fast.": {
        "chi": "pop子：是的，我们必须走快点"
    },
    "***We Need 25 Seconds To Break The Wall***": {
        "chi": "***我们需要25秒来打破南瓜墙壁***"
    },
    "***Find The Button To Open The TNT***": {
        "chi": "***找到TNT的按钮，众神之父会保佑我们***"
    },
    "***Captain.Li Hong:It's here.Dreamer Town.***": {
        "chi": "***uuz：我们来了，梦想家小镇***"
