    "***Zombie Will TP In 5 Seconds***": {
        "chi": "***南瓜僵尸将在5秒内传送***"
    },
    "***Doctor.He:This is our last chance.Let's go!***": {
        "chi": "***pop子：这是我们最后的机会了，我们走吧！***"
